  dialogues:
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a08506ee1b89c7845938ca68f692491c, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Access granted to Medical Supplies. I\u2019ve included a manual, though
      I suspect you\u2019ll just rub the ointment on the wound and hope for a miracle."
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c836f6a398f1a164db393ac1e08ce57d, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Activating the medical catalog. I\u2019ve noticed you\u2019re prone
      to 'existence-threatening injuries,' so I expect these to sell out fast."
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bbd3cb801043c8a44aa646da38b6da70, type: 3}
    subtitle: "I\u2019ve added Medkits to the inventory. I figured if I didn't, my
      best customer would eventually become a very quiet floor decoration."
